cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Scrubcast or its published assessments, please cite it as below.
title: "Scrubcast: launch weather rules checked against ensemble forecasts"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jawad
    given-names: Intesar
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/intesarjawad/scrubcast"
url: "https://scrubcast.intesarjawad.com/"
abstract: >-
  Scrubcast checks each published launch weather rule against the ECMWF and GFS ensemble
  members for every hour of a launch window, shows the official forecast beside it, and
  scores its own forecasts after every launch.
keywords:
  - launch weather
  - ensemble forecast
  - forecast verification
  - spaceflight
